Subject: [PATCH 5/6] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 .../{Swift.Collection+Difference.swift => Swift.Collection.swift} | 0
 .../Difference/{Swift.Int+Difference.swift => Swift.Int.swift}    | 0
 ...inter+Difference.swift => Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer.swift} | 0
 ...feRawPointer+Difference.swift => Swift.UnsafeRawPointer.swift} | 0
 ...Underlying == Difference, Tag is ~Copyable & ~Escapable.swift} | 0
 5 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Difference/{Swift.Collection+Difference.swift => Swift.Collection.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Difference/{Swift.Int+Difference.swift => Swift.Int.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Difference/{Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer+Difference.swift => Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Difference/{Swift.UnsafeRawPointer+Difference.swift => Swift.UnsafeRawPointer.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Difference/{Difference+Tagged.swift => Tagged where Underlying == Difference, Tag is ~Copyable & ~Escapable.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Difference/Swift.Collection+Difference.swift b/Sources/Difference/Swift.Collection.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Difference/Swift.Collection+Difference.swift
rename to Sources/Difference/Swift.Collection.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Difference/Swift.Int+Difference.swift b/Sources/Difference/Swift.Int.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Difference/Swift.Int+Difference.swift
rename to Sources/Difference/Swift.Int.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer+Difference.swift b/Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer+Difference.swift
rename to Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeMutableRawPointer.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeRawPointer+Difference.swift b/Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeRawPointer.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeRawPointer+Difference.swift
rename to Sources/Difference/Swift.UnsafeRawPointer.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Difference/Difference+Tagged.swift b/Sources/Difference/Tagged where Underlying == Difference, Tag is ~Copyable & ~Escapable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Difference/Difference+Tagged.swift
rename to Sources/Difference/Tagged where Underlying == Difference, Tag is ~Copyable & ~Escapable.swift
